cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use verified-reserving, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "verified-reserving: machine-checked claims reserving in Lean 4"
authors:
  - family-names: Sneiderman
    given-names: Robert
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-4519-2846"
url: "https://github.com/Robby955/verified-reserving"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Robby955/verified-reserving"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - actuarial science
  - chain ladder
  - claims reserving
  - formal verification
  - Lean 4
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of Mack's distribution-free chain-ladder model for
  claims reserving. The library separates exact conditional results from
  plug-in estimators and conventions, derives the observed-data form of the
  model from independent accident years, checks the published numerical
  example, and audits every listed declaration for proof dependencies.
